{
  "id": "code",
  "description": "Savant executable program source, source-adjacent configuration, build definitions, dependency locks, schemas, migrations, tests, and explicitly recognized program assets. Program files are admitted regardless of size. Runtime state, projections, snapshots, audits, reports, histories, backups, generated artifacts, environments, dependencies, caches, archives, media, and bulk semantic data are excluded.",
